Not sure which code you're referring to. My code is definitely working, but the issue might be a conflict between plugins. From your screenshot, it's clear you're using some choice plugins, and they can cause problems if they override the text command as well.
I’ve added an alias to the text command this should help resolve the conflict. Make sure this code is lower than any other choice/message plugins. If it still doesn't work, without knowing exactly which plugins you're using or what are doing I can't help.
